WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:03.500
[Radio chime] Welcome back to The Deep Cold Dispatch on Station Nova-1.

00:03.600 --> 00:07.800
I’m Talia Vance. System core temperatures just dropped another two degrees.

00:08.000 --> 00:12.500
Two degrees is being polite, Talia. Out in the belt, hydraulic fluid is slush.

00:12.800 --> 00:16.500
If you don't have an active heat core under your seat, you're flying a coffin.

00:16.800 --> 00:22.000
EDF High Command has officially established checkpoints at the Helios Jump Gate.

00:22.200 --> 00:27.000
All civilian haulers with fusion batteries are being impounded under Emergency Order 14.
